        },
        {
          "text": "Na andũ ma Kiliathi‐yealimu mooka, na mambatya ĩsandũkũ ya Yeova, na mayĩlikya nyũmbanĩ ya Avinatavu kĩĩmanĩ, na mamũvathan’ya Eleasali mwana wake ethĩwe mũtheu asũvĩe ĩsandũkũ ya Yeova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
