              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.15.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yel 15.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na yĩla Samueli wathembaa nthembo ya kũvĩvw’a, Avilisiti mathengeea mokite na Isilaeli; ĩndĩ Yeova amatundumĩa Avilisiti na kĩtundumo kĩnene mũthenya ũsu, na amathokoan’ya; na makũnwa mavalũkw’a nthĩ nĩ Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
