        },
        {
          "text": "Na ĩndĩ Avilisiti makĩlw’a vinya, na matyaalika ĩngĩ mũvakanĩ wa Isilaeli: na kw’oko kwa Yeova kwaĩ ĩũlũ wa Avilisiti matukũ onthe ma Samueli. ",
